# New chat on subject drift

If this thread has clearly switched to a new subject, and a fresh chat would be cheaper or clearer (long history, compacted context, or leftover files/screenshots from the old task), ask once whether to start a new chat.

Do not stop the current work. Do not ask on small follow-ups of the same task. One question, then continue if they stay.
